[h2]Build 0.9.5[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Merged titles are now used exactly as written.[/b] Nothing is pushed down any more. The only conflict is two titles setting the same kind of work, and then the title higher in the colonist's list wins. A Doctor + Crafter + Baseline colonist keeps the baseline title's Firefight, Patient and Rescue numbers.
[*]Each title row in the Colonists view shows how many of its boxes are set by a title above it.
[/list]
[list]
[*]Colonists holding more than one title are re-applied under the new rule the first time you open HR after loading.
[/list]
